  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Sustained declines in cargo and tanker transits signal a near-term global trade and growth slowdown, reducing long-horizon growth expectations and the term premium and thereby lowering long-term government bond yields.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
