  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Sustained increases in long-term sovereign yields raise governments' debt-servicing costs and fiscal deficits, forcing hard spending cuts or tax measures that amplify intra-coalition disagreements and can precipitate ministerial resignations or withdrawal of support.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
