  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">A sustained rise in long-term yields increases sovereign borrowing costs and projected debt-servicing for EU/US governments, prompting fiscal retrenchment or greater parliamentary scrutiny that delays, scales back or staggers large multi-year arms commitments to Ukraine.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">global_bond_repricing</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
