  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Rapid global portfolio flows into commodities push oil and gas prices up, raising Russian export revenues and short-term cash available to buy fuel, ammunition and sustain operational tempo, permitting an increase in strike/maneuver intensity.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">global_bond_repricing</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
</edge>
