  <data key="d35">0.65</data>
  <data key="d36">Large investor flows out of equities into bonds reduce valuations and dry up VC/late‑stage funding and M&amp;A liquidity for high‑risk tech firms, cutting available resources for R&amp;D and slowing the pace of new AI/accelerator and process innovations.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
